.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt CSRUTIL 8
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm csrutil
.Nd show the System Integrity Protection configuration
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm status
.Nm
.Cm enable | disable | clear
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm status
describes System Integrity Protection's configuration as the kernel has
it: enabled, disabled, or a custom configuration listing each protection.
.Pp
.Cm enable ,
.Cm disable
and
.Cm clear
change the configuration only from a recovery system, which Minkar does
not have; elsewhere they fail, as on macOS.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
